{
  "title": "koylu_muhabbet_hasan_celebi",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:selam",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Hasan Çelebi",
      "text": "My respects, master sentry. My reed pen registers the council ledger, and my ear weighs the peace of the village. Is there an urgent census record to enter?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Master scribe, do the village rolls and population tallies balance?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "What shall we do if a tax collector from the Sanjak or a brigand threat arrives?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Yesterday we admitted the weighmaster whose fraudulent weight was shattered; what did you record in your rolls?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Hasan Çelebi",
      "text": "Every soul that enters or departs, every bushel of grain placed into the granary I enter into the register, master. Where order reigns, abundance follows; a settlement without records is left to the mercy of outlaws."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Hasan Çelebi",
      "text": "I keep a secret ledger sheet concealed within my robe, master. I hold evidence to present any unlawful extortion by the Beylik before the Kadi. Our word carries weight in the high Divan against arbitrary taxes; I will not let the village's rights be usurped."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Hasan Çelebi",
      "text": "Shattering that weighmaster's dishonest scale and making him swear an oath of repentance was recorded on the ledger of justice, master. Scales will not waver in our marketplace; merchants now revere the gatekeeper's justice."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_normal",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, -180.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_kriz",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 0.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_karar",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 180.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:end",
      "type": "END",
      "position": "(1750.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_sukru",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 360.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "We brought Molla Sukru before the Plane Tree Council, Hasan Celebi; his counterfeit charter was laid bare."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_sukru",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 360.0)",
      "character": "Hasan Celebi",
      "text": "Look upon the Sultanic cipher on this charter, folk! Its ink smells of linseed oil applied but last week! The sentry laid bare the deceit; the balance of truth remains uncorrupted, praise be to God."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_sukru",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 360.0)",
      "description": "Village Justice and Honor",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "3"
      ]
    }
  ],
